**CHAR32
TOP + SEQ-2 SEQ-3
SEQ-2 * IE SYS-1 -SUCC-2
SUCC-2 + SYS-2 DEL
SEQ-3 * IE SYS-1 SYS-2 -DEL
DEL * TM-A TM-B
SYS-1 + TM-A P1
SYS-2 + TM-B P2
ENDTREE
PROCESS TOP
IMPORT
  1.000000E-01 IE I
  2.000000E-01 TM-A
  2.500000E-01 TM-B
  1.000000E-01 P1
  1.500000E-01 P2
LIMIT 1.000000E-12
**FTITLE: success branch SEQ = F and not(S or DEL), delete-term gate DEL
*XEQ
